# Marley-Style Clinical Laboratory Workflow & Real-Time Notification System

This document outlines the complete end-to-end clinical lab workflow implemented across `slash-admin` (React/Vite) and `backend` (Django/DRF), powered by Celery asynchronous processing, Celery Beat periodic scheduling, and real-time streaming notifications via Redis Pub/Sub and Server-Sent Events (SSE).

---

